License selection — STATUS: OPEN

Payment Journey is intended for open-source release. The bootstrap handoff did
not select a license or identify the copyright holder. This file is a status
notice, not an open-source license or a grant of redistribution rights.

Before publishing an open-source release, the project owner must select the
license, confirm ownership and third-party compatibility, and replace this
notice with the complete applicable license text. See
 docs/governance/open-questions.md (O-01).

Third-party standards and specifications are outside any future project license
unless their own redistribution terms expressly permit inclusion.
